    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "141F4EB4A3D0D70C",
      "text": "Thanks. I’ll get straight to it.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "141F4FB4A3D0D8BF",
      "text": "It seems all of you in Team Star are headed for\\nexpulsion if you keep up your current activities.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "1422DCB4A3D3FE2D",
      "text": "So why won’t you break up the team and start\\nattending class at the academy again?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_23",
      "hash64": "B7B9762A841D36FC",
      "text": "That’s what you wanna know?\\c\\nAs it happens, we’re actually waitin’ on a pal...\\nthough we don’t know if they’ll be comin’ back.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "1422DBB4A3D3FC7A",
      "text": "A pal...? A close friend of yours, are they?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_24",
      "hash64": "B7B9752A841D3549",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "1422DAB4A3D3FAC7",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_25",
      "hash64": "B7B9742A841D3396",
      "text": "They’re only the strongest boss in all of\\nTeam Star!\\c\\nLike how there’s a Top Champion who’s the\\nabsolute number-one Trainer, y’know?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_26",
      "hash64": "B7B9732A841D31E3",
      "text": "They’re the one who invited us other bosses to\\nform the team. We call ’em the “big boss.”[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "1422D9B4A3D3F914",
      "text": "And where is this big boss of yours now?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_27",
      "hash64": "B7B9722A841D3030",
      "text": "Wouldn’t we like to know. We haven’t heard from\\n’em in, I dunno...must be a year and a half now.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "1422D8B4A3D3F761",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_28",
      "hash64": "B7B9812A841D49AD",
      "text": "We thought that if we kept Team Star going, then\\nthey’d get back in touch one day.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_29",
      "hash64": "B7B9802A841D47FA",
      "text": "But the teachers keep pressin’ us to call it quits,\\nand then we get party crashers like you two...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "1422D7B4A3D3F5AE",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_30",
      "hash64": "B7B5F32A841A228C",
      "text": "Maybe the big boss did ditch us... They were\\ntalkin’ about breakin’ up the team before and all.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "1422D6B4A3D3F3FB",
      "text": "So, Team Star and this big boss of yours...\\nThey’re really that important to you?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_31",
      "hash64": "B7B5F42A841A243F",
      "text": "Heh. Is the sky blue?\\c\\nLet me put it in words you eggheads at the\\nacademy might understand...\\c\\nThey’re my greatest treasure.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
